      "asset": "narrator-analyst",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "TalkingCharacter",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "the turn \u2014 held beat [continued]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 68,
      "start": 306.43,
      "end": 311.37,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "And building one from scratch isn't a supply chain decision, it's closer to building a",
      "asset": "refinery-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 69,
      "start": 311.37,
      "end": 318.33,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "chemical weapons plants worth of infrastructure. Hundreds of precise separation stages, extreme heat",
      "asset": "refinery-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "LoopedIdle"
    },
    {
      "id": 70,
      "start": 318.33,
      "end": 324.45,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "and acid at every step. And because most rare earth ore comes bundled with thorium and uranium,",
      "asset": "ore-rock-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "radioactive waste stream"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 71,
      "start": 325.11,
      "end": 330.51,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "a radioactive waste stream that has to be handled by design, not as an afterthought.",
      "asset": "refinery-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 72,
      "start": 331.59,
      "end": 338.59,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "Today, real industrial scale rare earth refining exists in exactly three places outside China.",
      "asset": "world-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "ProgressiveReveal",
      "overlay": {
        "pins": [
          "Malaysia"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 73,
      "start": 339.31,
      "end": 344.13,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "Malaysia, a small facility in the United States, and one plant in Estonia.",
      "asset": "world-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "ProgressiveReveal",
      "overlay": {
        "pins": [
          "Malaysia",
          "United States",
          "Estonia"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 74,
      "start": 345.21,
      "end": 350.33,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "That's the entire non-Chinese refining capacity on earth. Building a new one,",
      "asset": "world-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 75,
      "start": 350.59,
      "end": 356.25,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "from permit to output, takes the better part of a decade. Nobody budgets for a choke point",
      "asset": "countdown-clock",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 76,
      "start": 356.25,
      "end": 361.87,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "that hasn't closed yet. And the choke point doesn't need to physically close to work.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "start": 362.49,
      "end": 364.77,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "It just needs a form to sit on a desk.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "start": 365.55,
      "end": 367.75,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "The shipment's ready. It's sitting at the port.",
      "asset": "factory-manager",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "SplitPhoneCall",
      "speaker": "Factory Manager",
      "overlay": {
        "pane": "A",
        "note": "urgent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "start": 368.23,
      "end": 369.85,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "Is the export license signed?",
      "asset": "export-official",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "SplitPhoneCall",
      "speaker": "Export Official",
      "overlay": {
        "pane": "B",
        "note": "flat, bureaucratic"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "start": 370.69,
      "end": 371.57,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "Not yet.",
      "asset": "factory-manager",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "SplitPhoneCall",
      "speaker": "Factory Manager",
      "overlay": {
        "pane": "A",
        "note": "tense, hesitant"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 81,
      "start": 372.17,
      "end": 375.53,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "Then it's not moving. Doesn't matter what's in the container.",
      "asset": "export-official",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "SplitPhoneCall",
      "speaker": "Export Official",
      "overlay": {
        "pane": "B",
        "note": "matter-of-fact"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 82,
      "start": 375.87,
      "end": 382.05,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "This is the trap, and it's the same one every resource choke point eventually teaches its owner.",
      "asset": "narrator-analyst",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "TalkingCharacter"
    },
    {
      "id": 83,
      "start": 382.81,
      "end": 387.93,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "You don't need to block the material, you need to control one signature the material can't move",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 84,
      "start": 387.93,
      "end": 393.23,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "without. A licensing office in Beijing can do more to an American factory floor",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 85,
      "start": 393.23,
      "end": 397.93,
      "chapter": "THE TRAP",
      "text": "than a naval blockade ever could, and it never has to fire a shot to do it.",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "[continued]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 86,
      "start": 398.24,
      "end": 404.46,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "In April 2025, China added seven rare earth elements and the magnets made from them to",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "label": "April 2025 controls"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 87,
      "start": 404.46,
      "end": 409.28,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "its export control list, timed almost exactly to a new round of American tariffs.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 88,
      "start": 409.96,
      "end": 416.32,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "In October 2025, it went further, then suspended the new controls for one year as part of",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "label": "Oct 2025 suspended"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 89,
      "start": 416.32,
      "end": 421.96,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "a trade truce, but kept the April restrictions and the licensing infrastructure fully in place.",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "label": "Oct 2025 suspended",
        "note": "[continued]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 90,
      "start": 422.76,
      "end": 424.6,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Restraint, not retreat.",
      "asset": "narrator-analyst",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "TalkingCharacter"
    },
    {
      "id": 91,
      "start": 426.02,
      "end": 432.66,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Then, on June 22nd, 2026, it added 10 more American companies straight to the list,",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "label": "10 companies added"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 92,
      "start": 433.04,
      "end": 435.96,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "including two of the biggest rare earth names in the country.",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 93,
      "start": 436.5,
      "end": 439.62,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Prices on some of these materials have already spiked sixfold.",
      "asset": "price-spike-chart",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 94,
      "start": 440.18,
      "end": 445.0,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "European manufacturers report export license approval rates below one in four,",
      "asset": "price-spike-chart",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 95,
      "start": 445.18,
      "end": 451.1,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "and that one year suspension from October runs out on November 10th, 2026,",
      "asset": "countdown-clock",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "the ticking-clock beat"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 96,
      "start": 451.76,
      "end": 452.86,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "a few months from now.",
      "asset": "countdown-clock",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 97,
      "start": 453.35,
      "end": 458.34,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "If it isn't renewed, five more rare earth elements snap back under full control,",
      "asset": "china-map-base",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "ProgressiveReveal"
    },
    {
      "id": 98,
      "start": 458.72,
      "end": 465.18,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "all at once, on companies and supply chains that haven't had time to prepare for the first round, let alone a second.",
      "asset": "countdown-clock",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 99,
      "start": 465.82,
      "end": 468.8,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Nobody knows yet whether that deadline gets extended again.",
      "asset": "countdown-clock",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "start": 469.48,
      "end": 472.46,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "That's not an oversight in this story, that's the story.",
      "asset": "narrator-analyst",
      "variant": "A",
      "technique": "TalkingCharacter"
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "start": 473.08,
      "end": 475.14,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "The leverage was never a one-time event.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "start": 475.74,
      "end": 480.74,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "It's a switch China can flip, loosen and flip again, watching exactly how much",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "LoopedIdle"
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "start": 480.74,
      "end": 484.04,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "pressure the rest of the world can absorb before flipping it back.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "LoopedIdle",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "[continued]"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 104,
      "start": 484.88,
      "end": 485.78,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "The mines can reopen.",
      "asset": "mountain-pass-mine",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 105,
      "start": 486.56,
      "end": 486.96,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "They have.",
      "asset": "mountain-pass-mine",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 106,
      "start": 487.54,
      "end": 490.14,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "The ore is still down there, same as it always was.",
      "asset": "ore-rock-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 107,
      "start": 490.78,
      "end": 493.76,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Digging it up was never the hard part, and it never will be.",
      "asset": "ore-rock-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 108,
      "start": 494.36,
      "end": 498.04,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Learning to finish it, that's the part nobody else built in time.",
      "asset": "refinery-icon",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns"
    },
    {
      "id": 109,
      "start": 499.32,
      "end": 502.96,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "Until that changes, it doesn't matter whose flag is on the hill.",
      "asset": "mountain-pass-mine",
      "variant": "B",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "closing callback"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 110,
      "start": 503.48,
      "end": 505.3,
      "chapter": "THE CLOCK",
      "text": "The stamp still says Beijing.",
      "asset": "stamp-signature-anim",
      "variant": "M",
      "technique": "KenBurns",
      "overlay": {
        "note": "closing line \u2014 final stamp image"
      }
    }
  ]
}